  #   affiliation: ""
  #   orcid: ""
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aaramis/CurateMake"
url: "https://github.com/Aaramis/CurateMake"
keywords:
  - ITS
  - metabarcoding
  - DNA metabarcoding
  - reference database curation
  - taxonomy validation
  - phylogenetic placement
  - Snakemake
  - bioinformatics workflow
abstract: >-
  CurateMake is a reproducible Snakemake workflow that ingests heterogeneous ITS
  (ITS1/ITS2) barcode datasets, harmonises their taxonomy against the Catalogue
  of Life, extracts barcode regions with ITSx, builds curated multiple-sequence
  alignments, validates taxonomic labels phylogenetically with SATIVA, and stores
  every record in a fully traceable relational database.
